  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Programmatic Public Sector Development Policy Loan (PPDPL 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PPDPL series supports a sustained medium-term process of legal, institutional, and structural development that promotes growth, improves public governance and service delivery and strengthens social conditions by (a) maintaining an enabling  macroeconomic framework; (b) reforming the country#s social protection system, (c) continuing the ongoing process of upgrading financial controls and public expenditure management, and (d) improving the administration and governance of the public sector.</narrative>
  </description>
